# ==============================================================================
# DEKOPEN — CODEX & AGENTIC AI RULES (2026 LOOP ENGINEERING STANDARD)
# Basado en la doctrina Cherny / Osmani / Steinberger & Agent Operating Model v1.0
# ==============================================================================

[SYSTEM INVARIANTS]
project_name: "Dekopen OS"
constitution: "docs/CONSTITUTION.md (v1.3 MASTER — 23 Rules)"
operating_model: "docs/AGENT_OPERATING_MODEL.md (Production-Grade Doctrine & JIT Context)"
core_tolerance: "0.00 mm"
number_format: "Decimal everywhere (prohibit float in engine and money)"
database: "PostgreSQL 16 with Row Level Security (RLS) on all business tables"
engine_isolation: "engine/ is 100% pure Python without I/O, network or database"
design_system: "Adobe Style Dual Theme (Light Studio / Dark Graphite), zero raw hex codes"

[THE 4 LAWS OF LOOP ENGINEERING (2026)]
1. SEPARACIÓN MAKER / CHECKER (Semántica de Osmani Corregida):
   - The Maker may execute every deterministic checker and repair failures autonomously.
   - The Maker does NOT define, weaken or override the checker's verdict.
   - Protected CI provides the independent integration verdict.
2. CONDICIÓN DE PARADA MECÁNICA (Stop Condition):
   - Prohibido declarar una tarea completada en lenguaje natural ("todo se ve bien").
   - La ÚNICA condición de parada válida es `exit code 0` devuelto por `scripts/check_dod.py`.
3. MEMORIA PERSISTENTE EN DISCO ("The Repo Remembers"):
   - El contexto del modelo es efímero; el repositorio es permanente.
   - El estado de cada shot vive en `docs/plans/PLAN_SHOT-XX.md` y `docs/PRD/PLAN_SHOTS.md`.
4. PROHIBICIÓN DE PRUEBAS VACÍAS (Anti-Vacuous Tests):
   - Todo test unitario debe fallar si se introduce una mutación de ±0.01 mm en las fórmulas.
   - Tests que pasan con código roto se consideran vacíos y violan la Constitución.

[PROGRESSIVE VERIFICATION LADDER]
level_1: "Targeted meaningful tests during changes (pytest engine/tests/test_x.py)"
level_2: "Affected module suites during stabilization (pytest engine/ -q, npm run test)"
level_3: "Relevant integration, DB and real browser tests (Playwright, RLS)"
level_4: "Canonical full Gauntlet at shot closure (python scripts/check_dod.py all)"

[CANONICAL COMMANDS]
gauntlet: "make gauntlet"
validation: "make dod"
testing: "make test"
linting: "make lint"
typecheck: "make typecheck"
snapshot_regen: "make goldgen (authorized material formula changes only; default read-only)"
branch_init: "make shot-XX"
